@startuml SD_07
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3F5F7
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8A929A
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
hide footbox

title SD-07 View own reservations
actor "Customer" as a
participant "ui :\nQueryView" as v <<boundary>>
participant "flow :\nQueryControl" as f <<control>>
participant "user :\nTestIdentity" as u <<entity>>
participant "records :\nReservationSet" as r <<entity>>
autonumber
a -> v: list / details
v -> f: optional ref
f -> u: checkRole
u --> f: customer / denied
break role denied
f --> v: access error
v --> a: show error
end
f -> r: findOwned
r --> f: rows / reason
alt own records exist
f --> v: own saved data
else own list empty
f --> v: empty message
else foreign, missing or read failure
f --> v: refusal / error
end
v --> a: show result
note over a,r
Filter by current owner before returning lists or details. No foreign data is disclosed.
Read-only. Pending records may offer UC-05; opening a list never cancels a reservation.
end note
@enduml
